    "body": "I wonder if browsers even do this. Do you know what Gecko does here? @junov, any idea on Blink?\n\nProvisionally, it seems like a switch to active document would be at the very least more correct, so I'll try to put together that change tomorrow.\n\nMaybe the intent here was to make it so that navigated-away-from-documents don't need to keep their font-faces around in memory in case someone decides to use a DrawingStyle saved from them? I dunno.\n",
