    "body": "Do which?  Gecko doesn't implement `DrawingStyle` at all so far, afaict, and doesn't implement the `CanvasRenderingContext2D` constructor, so none of the language I'm complaining about is relevant to us so far.\n\n> Maybe the intent here was to make it so that navigated-away-from-documents don't need to keep\n> their font-faces around in memory\n\nDunno.  I really wish specs came with \"why is it like this?\" explanations for every line... ;)\n",
