    "updated_at": "2015-12-04T23:22:57Z",
    "body": "@junov thanks, that's very helpful! It sounds like we can actually remove the two problematic things and not worry about this so much :).\n\nWe should definitely remove DrawingStyle. This seems to mean we can merge CanvasDrawingStyles back in to CanvasRenderingContext2D. Do you agree? Or perhaps will that interface be useful in your refactorings?\n",
